 construction to provide a comfortable and elegant environment.Barari Views also offers a range of world-class amenities including a fully equipped fitness centre, swimming pools, landscaped gardens, children's play areas and a community clubhouse. Residents can enjoy a serene and tranquil lifestyle with plenty of opportunities for relaxation and recreation.The location of the complex is another speciality. It is located in the exclusive neighbourhood of Majan, known for its lush greenery and serene ambience. The complex is well connected to major road networks, allowing easy access to other parts of Dubai including business districts, shopping malls and entertainment centres.Barari Views offers premium accommodation through luxurious properties, beautiful views and high-end amenities. It is an ideal choice for those looking for a tranquil and upscale atmosphere in one of Dubai's most prestigious neighbourhoods.","price":936100,"title":"Barari Views","bitrix":{"id":809,"pf_id":"are.3.12417","source":null,"project_id":"Majan","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Barari Views","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Premier Choice","project_location":"Dubai Land"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/623/images/2023/12/22/340x252/HoYtMYIw8EOyRtiBvtd7brFJDzVFCCnYRwRI1ymX.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/623/images/2023/12/22/464x312/HoYtMYIw8EOyRtiBvtd7brFJDzVFCCnYRwRI1ymX.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0957074,"lng":55.2984531},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/623/images/2023/12/22/340x252/Wu88BSLnPyJU50r3qWjXNCyAVw1nWVfy3PPCrsTQ.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/623/images/2023/12/22/464x312/Wu88BSLnPyJU50r3qWjXNCyAVw1nWVfy3PPCrsTQ.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/623/images/2023/12/22/340x252/uB0QVBhFhdtfSxAlq2FY5Q1vYkVlWHLxFPudfNN2.webp","464x312":"https://d3h